 "html": "<img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/news/6a571f588055a.png\">\n<p>2026年度 社會組 職棋甄選-複賽，本日(7/17)進行第二天的賽事</p>\n<p>第四輪賽後戰況</p>\n<p>A組</p>\n<p>陳義豐  取得四連勝</p>\n<p>黃麒祐、黃昀宥、謝知勵 ，取得三勝一負</p>\n<p>B組</p>\n<p>蔡品倩 取得四連勝</p>\n<p>林秉寬、姬孝天、陳雲亮 ，取得三勝一負</p>\n<p>詳細戰績如下：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/11KOXhKt2IxKQolt_FE8akbXqx3CJ5zEDHLPSrtpmRSs/edit?gid=1758320847#gid=1758320847\">社會組 職棋甄選-複賽A組 成績表</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1k5nZgUwjHhXCtae1kgIQzbJAoTGFiH6o_X-b6mjVCO0/edit?gid=2060681847#gid=2060681847\">社會組 職棋甄選-複賽B組 成績表</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/2026%E5%B9%B4%20%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E7%B5%84%20%E8%A4%87%E8%B3%BDA%E7%B5%84%20%E8%B3%BD%E7%A8%8B%E8%A1%A8_page-0001%20%282%29.jpg\">------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/2026%E5%B9%B4%20%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E7%B5%84%20%E8%A4%87%E8%B3%BDB%E7%B5%84%20%E8%B3%BD%E7%A8%8B%E8%A1%A8_page-0001%20%282%29.jpg\">------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260717_2.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260717_3.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260717_1.jpg\"></p>"
